%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A18%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1699432218008\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"请输入内容...\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/11/04/50494840/cff2d2b8c2a9ac728113600ed229ecdf_2370161033197640679.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">436</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">23</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">少女透过视窗，看那蓝绿色的星球越变越小。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">她挥手告别，她下定决心。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「马文，别担心，这一次，我没有害怕。」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「每颗星星，都可能蕴含着希望，点燃新的火种呀。而且，你听——」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「星星们，也想和我做朋友呢。」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">星维力场</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:17秒]展开十字架【召唤物】：生成一个【卫星】扫描全场，对范围内敌人造成300%攻击力的物理伤害，随后每隔2秒造成100%攻击力的物理伤害，持续16秒，期间自身造成的流血伤害提高25.0%，天行 · 绘星之卷装备时【陨石】额外造成300.0%攻击力物理伤害，命中敌人时回复自身300点生命值</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">星烁防线</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">全队造成的流血伤害提高15.0%，该效果唯一生效，天行 · 绘星之卷使用时，自身造成物理伤害提高30.0%，全队物理伤害提高35.0%，该效果唯一生效</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">星河信标</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">全队造成的全伤害提高15.0%，该效果唯一生效，天行 · 绘星之卷装备时，触发特殊武器技时，聚集【信标】周围敌人并造成50.0%攻击力的物理伤害（该伤害视为流血伤害）</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/2841/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/11/04/50494840/17c9893ae17f412e4957e536a5a7bec7_4825238807867862057.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「游航的定锚」图鉴后任意十字架蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_b