te-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">最佳推荐武器，提高输出和辅助能力并提供聚怪能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/11/08/50494840/582376f219f2a4ca91f5833dea362b83_739045796810601279.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">武器主动造成物理伤害，装备时提高全队全伤和流血伤害，自身流血伤害进一步提高；</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">天行 · 绘星之卷装备时全队物伤额外提高，自身物伤一进步提高；【陨石】造成额外伤害并回复生命值，特殊武器技提供一定的聚怪能力。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">该武器于适用于流血伤害的角色，同时具有着通用的增伤辅助能力。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/11/08/50494840/582376f219f2a4ca91f5833dea362b83_739045796810601279.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
